Modifications from the original distribution (changes were made):
1. Subset extraction — only the Tokyo-Station third-level mesh 53394611 is
   included (building GML, its appearance/texture directory with 3,124 JPG
   files, code lists, metadata, and specification documents). The rest of the
   ward-wide package is not included.
2. Mesh split — the third-level mesh file 53394611_bldg_6697_op.gml was split
   into four fourth-level mesh files (533946111–533946114_bldg_6697_op.gml)
   to keep files reviewable in pull requests. Building contents, IDs, and the
   appearance directory are unchanged by the split.
3. Ongoing collaborative edits — buildings are updated through reviewed pull
   requests; every change is recorded in the git history of this repository
   (per-building commits with a Building: trailer). docs/provenance-rules.md
   defines how sources are recorded inside the data.

Texture images: the JPG texture files under
13101_chiyoda-ku_pref_2023_citygml_1_op/udx/bldg/53394611_bldg_6697_appearance/
are part of the original PLATEAU distribution (CC BY 4.0, same attribution).
Newly contributed images must follow docs/data-contribution-policy.md
(rights, no identifiable persons / plates, removal-request contact).

